   "source": [
    "# 01 - Data Exploration\n",
    "\n",
    "Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) untuk proyek Deteksi Banjir Semarang.\n",
    "\n",
    "Notebook ini memuat:\n",
    "- Ringkasan dataset\n",
    "- Distribusi curah hujan per area\n",
    "- Histogram elevasi\n",
    - Distribusi kelas target banjir\n",
    "- Time series curah hujan untuk 3 area teratas\n",
    "- Heatmap korelasi fitur numerik"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Import Libraries"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "import warnings\n",
    "\n",
    "warnings.filterwarnings('ignore')\n",
    "%matplotlib inline\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.rcParams['figure.figsize'] = (12, 6)\n",
    "plt.rcParams['font.size'] = 12\n",
    "sns.set_style('whitegrid')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Load Data"
